{"4078720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INORBS", "steam_appid": 4078720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INORBS is an adventure and puzzle game that immerses you in a captivating world. With a perfect balance between virtual reality environments and an enveloping soundtrack, you will accompany the characters through infinite deserts and mountains that touch the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch their personalities being shaped throughout the story, understanding their origin, traumas and worries. Everything is told from an immersive and metaphorical perspective, where you will face monsters, mazes, and chases that will make you shudder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/4c4604edeec12929b6aac23e07fb9b1a.poster.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/4c4604edeec12929b6aac23e07fb9b1a.webm?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/4c4604edeec12929b6aac23e07fb9b1a.mp4?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lumen, the main character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumen, a luminous being who faces the death of his mother. Alone, he must venture in search of a new future in a universe full of challenges. On his way, he will meet other beings like him and, with them, he will discover empathy, companionship, and the importance of emotional bonds. However, he will also face the darkness that surrounds him and, most importantly, the darkness he carries within himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/058ed3a9ac1a6a2c84bb12c9517ca46f.poster.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/058ed3a9ac1a6a2c84bb12c9517ca46f.webm?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/058ed3a9ac1a6a2c84bb12c9517ca46f.mp4?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game tells a story about the loss of loved ones, self-improvement, and survival in an adverse world. It shows how hope can reappear and how new emotional bonds can be created. The story is based on the life experiences of its creators, who wish to share their experiences with others, just as the protagonists do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/a3329b28de4688091d794f7c81cc14c0.poster.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/a3329b28de4688091d794f7c81cc14c0.webm?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/a3329b28de4688091d794f7c81cc14c0.mp4?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are building a community to share the secrets, processes, and more details of the game. We will soon publish the DEMO, and we would love to receive your feedback to help us improve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, you can follow us on Instagram: @LUMEN.VR, where we will post all the news. Very soon we will open our own Discord server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/38cc63a8b328380e48d48890de16b235.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the development and art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the development and artistic process of INORBS closely. We will publish all the news monthly so that you can get to know our small team and discover how we work, from new sketches and concept art to new mechanics and beings that are incorporated into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/58177fc2e43f1382c427d7c958cd1113.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INORBS is an adventure and puzzle game that immerses you in a captivating world. With a perfect balance between virtual reality environments and an enveloping soundtrack, you will accompany the characters through infinite deserts and mountains that touch the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch their personalities being shaped throughout the story, understanding their origin, traumas and worries. Everything is told from an immersive and metaphorical perspective, where you will face monsters, mazes, and chases that will make you shudder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/4c4604edeec12929b6aac23e07fb9b1a.poster.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/4c4604edeec12929b6aac23e07fb9b1a.webm?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/4c4604edeec12929b6aac23e07fb9b1a.mp4?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lumen, the main character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumen, a luminous being who faces the death of his mother. Alone, he must venture in search of a new future in a universe full of challenges. On his way, he will meet other beings like him and, with them, he will discover empathy, companionship, and the importance of emotional bonds. However, he will also face the darkness that surrounds him and, most importantly, the darkness he carries within himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/058ed3a9ac1a6a2c84bb12c9517ca46f.poster.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/058ed3a9ac1a6a2c84bb12c9517ca46f.webm?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/058ed3a9ac1a6a2c84bb12c9517ca46f.mp4?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game tells a story about the loss of loved ones, self-improvement, and survival in an adverse world. It shows how hope can reappear and how new emotional bonds can be created. The story is based on the life experiences of its creators, who wish to share their experiences with others, just as the protagonists do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/a3329b28de4688091d794f7c81cc14c0.poster.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/a3329b28de4688091d794f7c81cc14c0.webm?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/a3329b28de4688091d794f7c81cc14c0.mp4?t=1759967077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are building a community to share the secrets, processes, and more details of the game. We will soon publish the DEMO, and we would love to receive your feedback to help us improve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, you can follow us on Instagram: @LUMEN.VR, where we will post all the news. Very soon we will open our own Discord server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/extras/38cc63a8b328380e48d48890de16b235.avif?t=1759967077\" width=820 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the development and art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the development and artistic process of INORBS closely. We will publish all the news monthly so that you can get to know our small team and discover how we work, from new sketches and concept art to new mechanics and beings that are incorporated into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078720/e